    "description": "<p>Your fight or flight response is finely honed - able to get you out of the stickiest of situations.</p><p>The user gains the @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-abilities.kDYV4gKQkqKP04Mf]{Adrenaline} as a Tutored Ability, and once during a combat, when they cross the @Trait[desperation-1-2] threshold, they may spend @PP[-3] to freely use either @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-moves.DTnhRJBYhTBapjIK]{U-Turn} or @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-moves.Yl9mMjXxnNloKmMS]{No Retreat} as an @Trait[interrupt] as if the Move was on their Active List.</p>",
